[{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-061","subject":"生理学","topic":"伸張反射","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"伸張反射の受容器はどれか。","choices":["筋紡錘","腱器官だけ","自由神経終末だけ","Pacini小体だけ","網膜"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"伸張反射＝筋紡錘→Ia求心性線維→同名筋α運動ニューロン。","explanation":"筋が急に伸ばされると筋紡錘が反応し、Ia求心性線維を介して脊髄へ入力し、同名筋のα運動ニューロンを興奮させる。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Stretch Reflex","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK545161/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"61","rightsBasis":"神経生理の基礎事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-062","subject":"生理学","topic":"運動単位と動員","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"筋力を徐々に増加させるときの運動単位動員について正しいのはどれか。","choices":["一般に小さい運動単位から大きい運動単位へ動員される","常に最大の運動単位だけが最初に動員される","運動単位の数は筋力に影響しない","α運動ニューロンは関与しない","随意運動では運動単位は活動しない"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"サイズの原理＝小さい低閾値運動単位から大きい高閾値へ。","explanation":"Hennemanのサイズの原理では、必要筋力の増加に伴い低閾値の小さな運動単位から高閾値の大きな運動単位へ順次動員される。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Motor Unit Recruitment","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK10813/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"62","rightsBasis":"運動生理の一般原則を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-063","subject":"生理学","topic":"副交感神経と骨盤神経","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"骨盤内臓神経に含まれる副交感神経線維の起始髄節はどれか。","choices":["S2〜S4","C1〜C4","T1〜T4","T5〜T9","L1〜L2だけ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"副交感＝脳幹＋仙髄S2〜S4。骨盤