neDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"65","rightsBasis":"血液生理の基礎事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-066","subject":"生理学","topic":"免疫グロブリン","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"胎盤を通過し胎児へ受動免疫を与える主要な免疫グロブリンはどれか。","choices":["IgG","IgM","IgAだけ","IgDだけ","IgEだけ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"胎盤通過＝IgG。分泌液＝IgA。一次応答初期＝IgM。","explanation":"IgGはFc受容体を介して胎盤を通過し、胎児・新生児へ母体由来の受動免疫を与える。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Immunoglobulin Physiology","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK513460/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"66","rightsBasis":"免疫学の基礎事実を独自作問。図表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-067","subject":"生理学","topic":"肝臓の機能","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"肝臓の機能として正しいのはどれか。","choices":["アルブミンの合成","インスリンの主な分泌","赤血球の主な産生（成人）","尿の濃縮","肺胞換気"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"肝臓＝蛋白合成、胆汁産生、代謝、解毒、貯蔵など。","explanation":"アルブミンや多くの凝固因子は肝臓で合成される。成人の赤血球産生は主に骨髄、インスリン分泌は膵β細胞で行われる。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Liver Physiology","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK535438/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"67","rightsBasis":"生理学の基礎事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-068","subject":"生理学","topic":"ホルモンの分泌臓器","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"抗利尿ホルモン（ADH、バソプレシン）が血中へ放出される部位はどれか。","choices":["下垂体後葉","甲状腺","副腎皮質","膵β細胞","副甲状腺"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"ADHは視床下部で合成され、下垂体後葉から放出。","explanation":"ADHは視床下部の神経細胞で合成され、軸索輸送後に下垂体後葉から血中へ放出される。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Vasopressin Physiology","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK526069/"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"68","rightsBasis":"内分泌生理の基礎事実を独自作問。図版は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-069","subject":"生理学","topic":"エネルギー代謝とMETs","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"1 METの意味として最も適切なのはどれか。","choices":["安静時代謝量を基準とした運動強度の単位","最大筋力の1%","心拍数1回/分","酸素飽和度1%","歩行速度1m/秒"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"MET＝安静時代謝を1として活動強度を倍数表示。","explanation":"METは安静時代謝量を1とし、活動時のエネルギー消費をその何倍かで表す指標である。","sourceTitle":"CDC Physical Activity Intensity METs","sourceURL":"https://www.mhlw.go.jp/seisakunitsuite/bunya/kenkou_iryou/iryou/topics/dl/tp240424-08a_01.pdf","sourceRefs":["https://www.cdc.gov/physical-activity/php/about/measuring-physical-activity-intensity.html"],"sourceCheckedAt":"2026-08-13","lawBaselineDate":"2026-08-13","contentVersion":"0.1.0-dev","premium":false,"examRound":"59","questionNumber":"69","rightsBasis":"活動強度の一般概念を独自作問。表は転載しない。","originType":"originalized_from_official_topic","officialScoringStatus":"scored"},{"id":"RIGAKU-R59-AM-070","subject":"運動学","topic":"咀嚼筋と下顎運動","answerType":"singleChoice","prompt":"下顎を挙上して口を閉じる作用を持つ代表的な筋はどれか。","choices":["咬筋","顎二腹筋前腹だけ","オトガイ舌骨筋だけ","胸鎖乳突筋","広頸筋だけ"],"correctIndices":[0],"blanks":[],"declarationFields":[],"memoryPoint":"閉口＝咬筋・側頭筋・内側翼突筋。開口＝舌骨上筋群＋外側翼突筋など。","explanation":"咬筋は下顎枝・角に付着し、下顎を挙上して咬合・閉口に働く主要な咀嚼筋である。","sourceTitle":"NCBI Muscles of Mastication","sourceURL":"h